        "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux\" style=\"display:none\">Instructions directly executable by a computer</div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1368532237\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:1.6em;margin-bottom:0.5em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote i{font-style:normal}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">For code that is completely internal to some CPUs and normally inaccessible to programmers, see <a href=\"/wiki/Microcode\" title=\"Microcode\">Microcode</a>.</div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">\"Native code\" redirects here. For the French colonial legal system, see <a href=\"/wiki/Native_code_(France)\" title=\"Native code (France)\">Native code (France)</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:W65C816S_Machine_Code_Monitor.jpeg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/W65C816S_Machine_Code_Monitor.jpeg/500px-W65C816S_Machine_Code_Monitor.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"340\" height=\"271\" style=\"--mw-file-upright: 1.35\" class=\"mw-file-element mw-file-upright\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/W65C816S_Machine_Code_Monitor.jpeg/960px-W65C816S_Machine_Code_Monitor.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1368\" data-file-height=\"1089\" /></a><figcaption>Machine l